<title>USA: Invacare gets 1.6 mln Healthdyne shares.</title>
<headline>Invacare gets 1.6 mln Healthdyne shares.</headline>
<dateline>ELYRIA, Ohio 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invacare Corp said Wednesday about 1,608,554 shares of Healthdyne Technologies Inc's common stock had been tendered as of its May 27 tender offer deadline.</p>
<p>Invacare said that with the 600,000 shares it owns, that amount represents more than 17 percent of outstanding Healthdyne common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it has extended its $13.50 per share tender offer for the outstanding shares of Healthdyne common stock until Friday, June 20.</p>
</text>
